          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Are bright lights, screens, or even everyday indoor lighting triggering your headaches or migraines? For many people, light sensitivity is a constant frustration that’s hard to explain and even harder to manage. Avulux® lenses are designed to help reduce light-related triggers so that you can go about your day with greater comfort and fewer interruptions.</p>",
          "id": "UNCBGCVTCq",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
