          "text": "Personalized Care for Migraine Relief",
          "html": "Personalized Care for Migraine Relief",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "yI7dCgdZpG",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>No two people experience migraines the same way, which is why we don’t take a one-size-fits-all approach. At <a href=\"/hours-location/\">Academy Vision</a>, our eye doctors take the time to understand what you’re dealing with, when your symptoms happen, what seems to trigger them, and how they affect your day. From there, we’ll help you decide if Avulux® lenses are a good fit and guide you through the next steps.</p>",
