          "text": "How Light Can Trigger Migraines",
          "html": "How Light Can Trigger Migraines",
          "id": "ozanJwHWjE",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Light sensitivity can show up in ways that are easy to overlook, but hard to deal with:</p><ul><li>Bright lights make your headaches feel worse</li><li>Screens leave your eyes feeling strained or overwhelmed</li><li>Indoor lighting feels harsher than it should</li><li>You find yourself avoiding certain environments</li><li>Headaches or migraines that don’t fully go away</li></ul>",
          "id": "jnGhlrcXQN",
