          "t": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "How Avulux® Lenses Work",
          "html": "How Avulux® Lenses Work",
          "id": "0QAzDxkUG9",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Avulux® lenses are designed differently from standard tinted or blue light glasses. Instead of simply darkening your vision, they filter out specific wavelengths of light that are known to trigger migraines.</p><p>That means you get protection where you need it, without making everything look dim or distorted. They’re made to be worn throughout your day, whether you’re inside, outside, or in front of a screen.</p>",
          "id": "43oebTkFzg",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
