          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "How Eyeglass Lenses Can Help with Migraines",
          "html": "How Eyeglass Lenses Can Help with Migraines",
          "id": "cJwh374yG5",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Avulux® lenses are designed to support your eyes without disrupting your routine:</p><ul><li>Help reduce sensitivity to light that can trigger migraines</li><li>Support more comfortable screen use throughout the day</li><li>Allow you to be in bright environments without feeling overwhelmed</li><li>Can be worn indoors and outdoors without darkening your vision</li></ul>",
          "id": "RSRr7Mnk0q",
